a:3:{s:3:"key";s:23:"cms:about:blocks_active";s:10:"expires_at";i:1786697101;s:4:"data";a:3:{i:0;a:12:{s:2:"id";i:1;s:15:"section_heading";N;s:13:"section_intro";N;s:11:"block_title";s:11:"Who We Are?";s:4:"body";s:771:"<p class="mb-2 text-muted lh-base fs-17 word-spacing-6">With an extensive industry experience spanning over two decades, mybrandplease.com has gained the trust of numerous global brands as their preferred manufacturing partner, facilitating the realization of their vision.</p><p class="mb-2 text-muted lh-base fs-17 word-spacing-6">Our team consists of dedicated personal care experts and enthusiasts who provide comprehensive assistance throughout your Private Label journey</p><p class="mb-2 text-muted lh-base fs-17 word-spacing-6">We offer an expansive range of product and packaging options, enabling you to craft a distinctive product line that is not only cost-effective and of superior quality but also proudly made in INDIA with unwavering love and passion.</p>";s:10:"image_path";s:46:"assets/imgs/about/Who-we-are-min-2048x1238.jpg";s:9:"image_alt";s:12:"Our Products";s:6:"layout";s:4:"left";s:10:"sort_order";i:1;s:9:"is_active";i:1;s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2026-08-13 18:27:29";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2026-08-13 18:27:29";}i:1;a:12:{s:2:"id";i:2;s:15:"section_heading";s:87:"We Located in the vibrant city of <span class="theme-color-font h3">Delhi, India</span>";s:13:"section_intro";s:189:"<span class="theme-color-font">mybrandplease.com</span> proudly operates as a trusted hub for numerous renowned brands, distinguished Spas, Hotels, Salons, &amp; Retailers across the globe.";s:11:"block_title";s:14:"What We Offer?";s:4:"body";s:771:"<p class="mb-2 text-muted lh-base fs-17 word-spacing-6">With an extensive industry experience spanning over two decades, mybrandplease.com has gained the trust of numerous global brands as their preferred manufacturing partner, facilitating the realization of their vision.</p><p class="mb-2 text-muted lh-base fs-17 word-spacing-6">Our team consists of dedicated personal care experts and enthusiasts who provide comprehensive assistance throughout your Private Label journey</p><p class="mb-2 text-muted lh-base fs-17 word-spacing-6">We offer an expansive range of product and packaging options, enabling you to craft a distinctive product line that is not only cost-effective and of superior quality but also proudly made in INDIA with unwavering love and passion.</p>";s:10:"image_path";s:52:"assets/imgs/about/what-do-we-offer-min-2048x1241.jpg";s:9:"image_alt";s:13:"Manufacturing";s:6:"layout";s:5:"right";s:10:"sort_order";i:2;s:9:"is_active";i:1;s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2026-08-13 18:27:29";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2026-08-13 18:27:29";}i:2;a:12:{s:2:"id";i:3;s:15:"section_heading";s:81:"Our relentless pursuit: safety, efficacy, and the essence of natural formulation.";s:13:"section_intro";N;s:11:"block_title";s:17:"How We Formulate?";s:4:"body";s:787:"<p class="mb-3 text-muted lh-base fs-17 word-spacing-6">Embracing scientific rigor, our formulations epitomize excellence, with premium ingredients securing robust shelf life and customer safety.</p><p class="mb-3 text-muted lh-base fs-17 word-spacing-6">The alchemy of science and nature converge in formulations that astound with tangible, transformative results. Our goal: ignite customer devotion, fueling repeat purchases and skyrocketing sales.</p><p class="mb-0 text-muted lh-base fs-17 word-spacing-6">We grasp the pivotal role of results-driven formulations, fusing the epitome of scientific innovation with the bounties of nature. Unveiling nature’s finest, we harness the potency of natural and organic ingredients, unveiling a realm of unparalleled beauty and wellness.</p>";s:10:"image_path";s:55:"assets/imgs/about/How-do-we-Formulate-min-2048x1241.jpg";s:9:"image_alt";s:16:"How We Formulate";s:6:"layout";s:4:"left";s:10:"sort_order";i:3;s:9:"is_active";i:1;s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2026-08-13 18:27:29";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2026-08-13 18:27:29";}}}